@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
title Stored migration run states
top to bottom direction
state queued
state running
state completed
state partial
state cancelled
state blocked
[*] --> queued
queued --> running : eligible batch
queued -right-> cancelled : cancellation observed
running --> completed : all processed / skipped
running -right-> partial : blocked operations
running -left-> cancelled : operation boundary
running --> blocked : profile revision changed
completed --> [*]
note bottom of partial : A new preview is needed for blocked operations.
note bottom of cancelled : Completed copies remain; pending work can use a new run.
@enduml
